# Files in dist/ that the Cloudflare Worker must never serve (wrangler.jsonc).
# Monchila is licensed: a local build with the TTF/OTF installed emits them to _astro/ even though no page
# uses them (src/lib/monchila.ts globs every format). Only the WOFF2 files may ship.
_astro/Monchila*.ttf
_astro/Monchila*.otf
